{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25799","headline":"忆登栖霞寺峰 · 李绅","name":"忆登栖霞寺峰","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"香印烟火息，法堂钟磬余。\n纱灯耿晨焰，释子安禅居。\n林叶脱红影，竹烟含绮疎。\n星珠错落耀，月宇参差虚。\n顾眺匪恣适，旷襟怀卷舒。\n江海淼清荡，丘陵何所如。\n滔滔可问津，耕者非长沮。\n茅岭感仙客，萧园成古墟。\n移步下碧峰，涉涧更踌躇。\n乌噪啄秋果，翠惊衔素鱼。\n回塘彩鷁来，落景标林箊。\n漾漾棹翻月，萧萧风袭裾。\n劳歌起旧思，戚叹竟难摅。\n却数共游者，凋落非里闾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25799.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25799","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}